OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning row over 'eyesore' car
OL,4,Astorage site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report from West Lindsey District
OL,7,FCouncil planning officers recommended
OL,8,Frejecting the application, describing
OL,9,Fthe development as "unsightly and
OL,10,Fincongruous to the character of the
OL,11,Farea", adding the applicant has
OL,12,Fprovided little detail about safety
OL,13,Fmeasures or the business.
OL,15,FOwner Ali Mohammed Saleh is applying
OL,16,Ffor retrospective planning permission
OL,17,Fand claimed the site was safe and not
OL,18,Funtidy.
